<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Winterthur.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Winterthur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on Winterthur.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    900.00 CHF		PREMIUM	10.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.53 CHF		  GEARING	17.1 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	21.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  861.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
